    "Argon2id at this PIM needs about %@ MB of memory, and VaultPony can use about %@ MB right now. Unlocking may fail." : {
      "comment" : "A warning that unlocks a vault with Argon2id will fail because the device doesn't have enough memory.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
